    "detailed_description": "Bookworm is a typing game where the goal is to score points by completing as many words as possible. The twist is that you can type in any direction you want - even up or down.<br><br>You are the Bookworm with an appetite for the finest words in the fairytale. Crawl from letter to letter in search for quest words to stay <i>golden</i>. While <i>golden</i>, your multiplier increases by covering words. Relax, take your time, but avoid dead ends and climb the leaderboard. <br><br>Each run begins somewhere in the 12 chapters of Lewis Carrolls' <i>Alice\u2019s Adventures in Wonderland</i>",
